<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MONDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,594.80 (1,599.90)	CHF  1,111.10 (1,113.50)</p>
<p>    DEM    952.23 (957.57)	  GBP  2,611.30 (2,624.80)</p>
<p>    ATS    135.29 (136.06)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $18.80 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $12.68 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $31.48 million ($57.17 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
</text>
